The problem is minimum depth of binary tree. Key subtlety: if a node has only one child, the minimum depth path must go through that child (since a leaf is a node with no children). So the standard recursion:

- If root is null, return 0.
- If root has no children (leaf), return 1.
- If left is null, return 1 + minDepth(right).
- If right is null, return 1 + minDepth(left).
- Otherwise return 1 + min(minDepth(left), minDepth(right)).

